      "reason": "The receiving DataTable/DataTableLayout/filter API defines this named ReactNode slot. It places filters/expanded fields/empty state in a different region from ordinary children. PricingCatalogPanel deliberately passes ReactNode content through DataTableLayout.filters and DataTable.emptyText. These are defined layout/empty-state slots, and converting them into ordinary children would change table composition. Existing backend rule ids remain row keys.",
